  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "*Cough* I do not know what is coming over me. But, yes, this circled group of names is intriguing.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_067.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The circles are quite vociferous, suggesting perhaps dissatisfaction with them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_068.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If any of the Ascended escaped their fate, it would certainly provoke such rage. We enjoyed the chase, you see, but only so long as we won.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_069.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yet, I have no idea where to look for these people. Have you found any other allies in the village? Perhaps they could help.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_070.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So there were survivors. Clever little morsels. Hmmm. Is this elation I feel? Relief? Why? I do not know these people, nor care to.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_071.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So why does their survival enchant me so? Could it be... that in removing one curse, the Broken Branch burdened me with another so common to mortals...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_072.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...That dread, choking impulse you call empathy?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_073.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
